%H A402343 Wolfgang Schwarz, <a href="https://doi.org/10.7146/math.scand.a-10836">Remarks on the irrationality and transcendence of certain series</a>, Mathematica Scandinavica, Vol. 20, No. 2 (1967), pp. 269-274; <a href="https://www.jstor.org/stable/24489854">JSTOR link</a>. See Theorem 3, p. 270.
